{"year":"2025","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 78th Cannes Film Festival took place from May 13 to 24, 2025, with <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1137, 'screen_type': person}\">Juliette Binoche</a> as jury president. Iran's <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 120229, 'screen_type': person}\">Jafar Panahi</a> won the Palme d'Or with <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1456349, 'screen_type': movie}\">Un simple accident</a> (It Was Just an Accident, 2025). Brazil left the festival with two awards for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1220564, 'screen_type': movie}\">O Agente Secreto</a> (The Secret Agent, 2025): <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1016214, 'screen_type': person}\">Kleber Mendonça Filho</a> won best director and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 52583, 'screen_type': person}\">Wagner Moura</a> best actor. Robert De Niro and Denzel Washington received honorary Palmes d'Or."},{"type":"person_list","title":"The Jury","persons":[{"id":1137,"name":"Juliette Binoche","profile_path":"/htdZZIroEyJaeHQAUTqokNfkPgl.jpg"},{"id":4587,"name":"Halle Berry","profile_path":"/84HRDZodRCuBSpYGSc3ow8WucI4.jpg"},{"id":1353901,"name":"Dieudo Hamadi","profile_path":"/2gWI2WxRPlJK6Q103WCCQ2SnAJH.jpg"},{"id":150975,"name":"Hong Sang-soo","profile_path":"/udE4B1f8x9IdOPuvKrH5PcBJ5cD.jpg"},{"id":1467320,"name":"Payal Kapadia","profile_path":"/nBH3sKTMMghVcmf58AdKumB3RBW.jpg"},{"id":20660,"name":"Carlos Reygadas","profile_path":"/xJzdv6CYRg4y6ZuZiCM28nUysxM.jpg"},{"id":128748,"name":"Alba Rohrwacher","profile_path":"/swffcvnDnj5966fdLSnXOMY186.jpg"},{"id":2455297,"name":"Leïla Slimani","profile_path":"/dOlZ5QxCaNG6hyEq3NCeakq1v3q.jpg"},{"id":239271,"name":"Jeremy Strong","profile_path":"/jcMhXWICSi4QjQttJVhFSiKVvpF.jpg"}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Palme d'Or","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1456349,"name":"It Was Just an Accident","image_path":"/tNRnqTcrbJQQd4MfthlPXoY4FNC.jpg","director":"Jafar Panahi","win